    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ABBY: What are you doing?!\nSTELLA: No one’s home. Let's climb up to the roof so we can get a view of the whole neighborhood.\nABBY: Are you crazy? This is trespassing.\nSTELLA: Only if we get caught.",
      "ABBY: Maybe prison won’t be so bad. I love to read, and maybe we can ask to be put in the same cell.\nSTELLA: Look.\nABBY: It’s incredible.",
      "STELLA: Run!\nABBY: Prison will be bad! I won't make it.\nSTELLA: Just go!\nSTELLA: Are you okay?",
      "ABBY: I can’t believe we did that! It was irresponsible and dangerous-\nSTELLA: And...?\nABBY: And...great. It was great.",
      "ABBY: Babe, I'm taking off.\nSTELLA: Now?\nABBY: Yeah. Why, do you need something?\nSTELLA: No, it can wait."
    ]
